    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d357-a2">

                <pb facs="0468" n="372" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg372"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. Beaupre.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-03-18"><hi rendition="#italic">March 18,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Invitation as arbitrator of question between Honduras and Great Britain appears
                    to be to you personally, and not as United States chargé d’affaires. In that
                    understanding you are permitted to accept, being careful to completely
                    dissociate your judicial function from your representative status.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
